    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "When will my order ship?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "\"Orders are mostly shipped within two business days with a signature requirement upon\n            delivery. Please note that this includes orders with expedited shipping. Orders placed on weekends or\n            on holidays will begin processing the following business day. Our warehouse is not open on the\n            weekends or holidays. You will be notified via email if items in your order are delayed or out of stock.\n            Orders received after 1 pm EST are considered as the next business day and are not guaranteed to\n            be shipped the same day.\""
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Where do you ship?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "We ship directly within the United States. For international orders, we partner with Global-e and\n            ship via DHL. Please see our international FAQ section below if you are ordering from outside the\n            United States."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How much is shipping?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "FedEx ground shipping is a $10 flat rate charge. We offer expedited FedEx delivery, including\n            Three-Day Select, Second Day Air, and Next Day Air. Expedited shipping charges vary depending on\n            the shipping address."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Why Global-e?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "We have partnered with Global-e to allow our international customers to shop with their local\n            currency securely online, receive cost-effective international shipping costs, and prepay duties and\n            taxes. All duties and taxes are collected at checkout and are not factored into the listing prices. At\n            checkout, you will be provided with a guaranteed order total in your local currency. The order total\n            presented will be the exact amount that Global-e Payments will bill you. There will not be any additional\n            costs billed upon delivery or due as COD charges if you pay the amount at checkout."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Canceling international orders",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "To cancel an order, please contact our Customer Care team urgently at\n            cs@whatgoesaroundnyc.com to request an order cancelation. We cannot cancel an order that has\n            already been fulfilled."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Returning international orders",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "International returns are subject to the same terms and conditions as orders placed in the\n            United States. Please refer to our Return Policy for instructions on how to initiate your return."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "International site credits and gift cards",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Unfortunately, we cannot offer site credits or gift cards for international orders."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How to initiate a return?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "To initiate your return request, send an email to cs@whatgoesaroundnyc.com.\n            Include your order number, the item(s) you wish to return, and the reason for returning.\n            Please allow the Customer Care team 2 business days to respond to your request.\n            Note that our business hours are Monday through Friday, 9 am to 5 pm EST.\n            Once the Customer Care team approves your return, please follow the instructions.\n            Returned items must be shipped within 3 business days of receiving a response from Customer Care.\n            The label will be void after this period, and the return will be ineligible.\n            Please save your tracking information for your reference. We suggest keeping the receipt provided by\n            FedEx to prove that your return has been scanned.\n            We are not responsible for lost returns that have not shown an initial scan at a FedEx facility.\n            Items purchased online cannot be returned to our store locations.\n            All online returns must be authorized by our Customer Care team and shipped to our warehouse via\n            the FedEx shipping label provided to you.\n            We are not responsible for lost or damaged items sent to us without authorization or our provided\n            shipping label.\n            Once we have received your return and it has been evaluated for condition and authenticity, you will\n            receive an email that your refund has been processed.\n            Returns can take 2-3 business days to be processed. After processing, your refund may take 5-7\n            business days to reflect in your account, depending on your payment method.\n            Any return requests made after the 7-day return period will be denied.\n            Items marked as FINAL SALE are not eligible for return.\n            Items purchased in our retail store locations are FINAL SALE and not eligible for return.\n            Items purchased through our wholesale partners are FINAL SALE."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Can I do an exchange?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "We do not offer exchanges. If you would like to exchange an item, please return the\n            original item for a refund or site credit (less original shipping cost) and place a new order."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Do you consign?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "What Goes Around Comes Around buys outright; we do not offer consignment. When you\n            sell your luxury item(s) to us, payment can be issued by one of the following methods:\n            • Paper check sent to your home\n            • Direct electronic payment to your bank account\n            • Store credit, where you can earn an extra 20% more than a cash payment"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How long does the whole selling process take?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "The selling process takes about 3 weeks total from acceptance to pay-out (in the event\n            there are no delays). After uploading your photos, the seller will receive an estimated offer if we are\n            interested in purchasing their item(s). If the seller would like to accept the estimated offer, we will issue\n            a prepaid shipping label for them to send in their item(s) to be checked for QA/QC in-house. After\n            receiving and checking the item(s) for authenticity and condition, our team will then either confirm the\n            estimated quote or propose a counteroffer in the case that the item(s) are in a different condition than\n            the original photos indicated.\n            Once the final offer is agreed upon, the seller will select their preferred method of payout. Store credit\n            is processed the same day and available for use on our website or at any What Goes Around Comes\n            Around store. Check and Direct Deposit payments are processed by our internal finance department,\n            and the payout is mailed or deposited within 10 business days."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What brands do you accept?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "We are currently buying luxury accessories from Chanel, Hermès, Gucci, Louis Vuitton,\n            Dior, Fendi, Prada, and YSL."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What items do you accept?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "We are currently buying handbags, luggage, small leather goods, jewelry, belts, scarves,\n            home goods, and much more from our list of accepted brands only."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What items do you not accept?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "We do not accept footwear, items outside our list of accepted brands, or any items that\n            have been damaged, altered, or customized."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Do you take men&#39;s luxury accessories?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes, we do take men&#39;s luxury accessories! We buy men’s luggage, leather goods, and\n            more from Hermès, Gucci, Louis Vuitton, Dior, and Prada."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How do I submit my items for sale?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "To submit items for sale and receive a quote for your luxury item(s), please send photos to\n            us at lux buyers@wgacany.com, and you will receive a reply within 7-10 business days. Please note\n            that our retail teams cannot offer this service, and it can only be done through e-mail. Follow our\n            luxury submission photo guide below to receive your estimated offer right away.\n            Please take clear photos of the best possible quality for your item(s) to be evaluated by the Buy Team.\n            The following images are required to receive a quote for your item(s):\n            1. Front of item\n            2. Back of item\n            3. Interior of item\n            4. Sides of item\n            5. Base/bottom of the item\n            6. Serial number, date code, or blind stamps. If you do not know where to look for this in your bag,\n            we are happy to show you where to find it.\n            If your item shows significant wear, please be sure to photograph and describe it clearly. Additional\n            photo angles for bags in used condition should include:\n            • Up-close image of corners\n            • Up-close image of handles, hardware & strap (if applicable)\n            • Interior pockets"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How do I send my item(s) to you?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "If you accept the estimated offer for your item(s), you will be issued a prepaid FedEx shipping\n            label via email. Use this label to send your item(s) to our Buying Office for QA/QC inspection. We do\n            not provide shipping materials to sellers. Please securely pack your item(s) using any box and packing\n            materials you see fit in order to maintain the condition and structure of the item(s). You can then drop\n            your package off at any FedEx facility or schedule a pickup."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How will I know if my item(s) have been received?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Sellers can track shipments using the FedEx tracking number. Once this page has been\n            updated to “Delivered” status, please allow 1-3 days for us to process your package. After QA/QC\n            inspection, the seller will receive an e-mail confirmation and update describing the next steps."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is there a maximum number of items I can submit for sale?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "There is no limit to how many items a seller can submit to us. Please remember to keep\n            submissions limited to only the accepted categories and brands we carry."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What are the advantages of receiving store credit versus cash?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "We offer a store credit value that’s 20% greater than the cash estimate issued for each\n            item submitted by a seller. Store credit can be redeemed at any WGACA retail location as well as on\n            our website."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How do you determine pricing?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "We determine the price of each item we buy based on its current market value, which can\n            vary by style, size, colorway, and, of course, condition. Other factors such as client demand, rarity,\n            accessibility, and our retail price are also considered when making our offers to sellers.\n            We offer full transparency to our sellers regarding the valuation of their luxury item(s) and do our best\n            to answer any questions."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Will you price match a quote from another company?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "We realize and understand that a seller might receive a higher offer for their luxury item(s)\n            from a different company, as we all have our own pricing structures, markups, and customer\n            demands. Although we do not practice price-matching, we are open to hearing your price expectations\n            and, in some cases, are open to negotiations."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What if you don&#39;t accept my item? What if I don&#39;t accept your updated offer if it has\n            changed after the inspection",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "If we pass on the item(s) due to condition and/or authenticity concerns, we will update you\n            via e-mail and ship the item(s) back to you immediately. If we are unable to authenticate the item, you\n            will need to provide us with a return label to send back. If you choose not to accept an updated offer\n            after the inspection or we do not come to an agreement on price, we will ship the item(s) back to you\n            immediately at no expense to you. All shipments are made via FedEx and are insured and tracked."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Will you tell me if my item is real or fake?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "We do not provide virtual authentication services. However, during the selling process, all\n            items are checked for authenticity in-house. If our team passes on an item due to authenticity\n            concerns, we are happy to explain how we came to that determination and describe the specific points\n            of concern if the seller wishes to hear them.\n            What Goes Around Comes Around takes authenticity very seriously and guarantees that only\n            authentic items are sold to our customers. For that reason, we cannot accept any item that we are not\n            100% confident is authentic."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "I purchased a bag from one of your wholesale partners. Can I return it to you?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Once an item is sold to a third-party wholesale partner such as Dillard&#39;s, Von Maur, or Belk,\n            we no longer own the product and cannot extend further courtesies on their behalf. If you wish to\n            return or exchange, it must be done with the wholesale partner and by their policy."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Do you offer a warranty?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "We do not offer warranties on any of our products due to the varying degrees of the\n            condition of each item at the time of purchase."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How do I register my bag?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Our feature to register on our website is still a work in progress."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "I purchased a bag from one of your wholesale partners, but I did not receive a branded\n            dust bag or box. Can you send me these items?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Unfortunately, we are not able to provide boxes or original dust bags for your purchase.\n            Each item is pre-owned and sometimes purchased without the original box or duster. Your handbag is\n            still guaranteed to be authentic without these effects."
      }
    }
  ]
}
</script>
</isdecorate>
